  - `dart analyze` on lib/plugin, lib/pages/video, lib/pages/live_room, lib/pages/danmaku and lib/tcp: no issues.
  - A Dart probe confirmed three things: the time regex matches ("今晚8:30见" → "8:30"); the late `!` field throws `_TypeError` when the widget value is null; the early-`return` loop drops later elements.
